---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold font-serif">
		About Us
	</h1>

    <div class="flex flex-col-2 items-center gap-8">
        <div class="w-full">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Why Choose Oakwards Travel?</h2>
			<p>
				Oakwards Travel is a leading transportation service provider offering reliable and professional services for a variety of purposes. Whether you need airport shuttle services, bus and coach rentals, or business transportation solutions, we have you covered. With a focus on customer satisfaction, we strive to make every journey comfortable, convenient, and enjoyable. Choose Oakwards Travel for all your transportation needs and experience the difference.
			</p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full">
            <img src="/src/assets/owt-2.jpg" alt="Photo of Oakwards Travel coach" class="rounded-lg">
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col-2 items-center gap-8 mt-10">
        <div class="w-full">
            <img src="/src/assets/owt-5.jpg" alt="Photo of Oakwards Travel coach" class="rounded-lg">
        </div>
        <div class="w-full">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Experience the Convenience and Comfort</h2>
			<p>Ready to embark on your next journey? Book your transportation with Oakwards Travel today and enjoy a hassle-free travel experience. Our dedicated team is committed to providing excellent service and ensuring your satisfaction. Don't settle for less when it comes to transportation. Choose Oakwards Travel and travel with peace of mind.</p>
		
			<a href="/contact"><button class="block bg-green-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg mt-4">Book now!</button></a>
        </div>
    </div>

</Layout>
